{"id":"122041b020150c8e","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Equivalence Class Map","display":"df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map — ZFC Set11 Equivalence Class Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map — ZFC Set11 Equivalence Class Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-set11-quotient-set-code.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-equivalence-class-map — ZFC Set11 Equivalence Class Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7f45d439462ca7fa\" href=\"?note=7f45d439462ca7fa\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set11-quotient-set-code.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-set11-quotient-set-code.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> (quotient projection function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> (domain set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (equivalence relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (quotient carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7f45d439462ca7fa\" href=\"?note=7f45d439462ca7fa\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set11-quotient-set-code.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-set11-quotient-set-code.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S\\)</span> (equivalence-relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11QuotientSetCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11QuotientSetCode}_S\\)</span> (quotient-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11EquivalenceClassMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11EquivalenceClassMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11EquivalenceClassMap}_S(q,A,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,A)\\land\\exists Q\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11QuotientSetCode}_S(Q,A,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,A,Q)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\bigl(q(x)=\\{y\\in A:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}equivalence\\text{-}class\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11EquivalenceClassMap}_S(q,A,E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,A)\\land\\exists Q\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11QuotientSetCode}_S(Q,A,E)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,A,Q)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\bigl(q(x)=\\{y\\in A:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The equivalence class is expanded as a set comprehension, and the codomain is the canonical quotient carrier rather than the whole power set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-set11-quotient-set-code.